  "description": "Diagnose why a user can or cannot see/edit a record: UserRecordAccess SOQL, Why Can a User Access This Record debug log, OWD, role hierarchy, sharing rules, manual/team/apex shares, implicit parent share. NOT for remediating a CRUD/FLS finding \u2014 use apex/apex-stripinaccessible-and-fls-enforcement. NOT for designing the sharing model itself \u2014 use admin/sharing-and-visibility.",
  "file_location": "skills/security/record-access-troubleshooting",
